{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burgie's cozy kitchen is a small wholesome game about managing your own street burger joint. Enjoy its cozy and relaxed style, with a few adorably chaotic moments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook for your customers and upgrade your burger joint \ud83c\udf54</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2011c10e427359d63ffe69f04a97e605.poster.avif?t=1768985240\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2011c10e427359d63ffe69f04a97e605.webm?t=1768985240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2011c10e427359d63ffe69f04a97e605.mp4?t=1768985240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 <strong>Relaxing</strong>, cute, and <strong>cozy game</strong> to play at <strong>your own pace</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Simple yet <strong>polished mechanics</strong>, <strong>all interconnected.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd2b Multiple <strong>secret mechanics to discover</strong> as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf42 A <strong>funny physics system</strong> that makes everything more real and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbb <strong>Play actively or minimize it on your desktop</strong> while you handle new orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1 <strong>4~8 hours of progressively unlockable content</strong>. Concludes with a leaderboard for those who want to continue longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play while you work or play other things \u270d</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/e2d372fb49a40ba931374a85cde49a06.poster.avif?t=1768985240\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/e2d372fb49a40ba931374a85cde49a06.webm?t=1768985240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/e2d372fb49a40ba931374a85cde49a06.mp4?t=1768985240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows you to <strong>minimize the counter to a corner of the screen</strong> to focus on other tasks while waiting for new orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a new order comes in, a bell rings to prepare their burger and serve them as best as possible. <strong>Tips and improving your kitchen will depend on their reviews!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different game modes \ud83d\udd79</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2362ce182aebce503a796def45dfc96e.poster.avif?t=1768985240\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2362ce182aebce503a796def45dfc96e.webm?t=1768985240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/2362ce182aebce503a796def45dfc96e.mp4?t=1768985240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Frenetic Mode:</strong> Play actively with constant impatient picky customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2615 <strong>Relax Mode:</strong> Minimize the game, attending to customers every 5-15 minutes, and <strong>brighten your day with short breaks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcda <strong>Pomodoro Mode:</strong> Minimize the game, <strong>set the timer</strong>, and a new customer will notify you when it's time to take a break. <strong>Ideal as a gamified focus tool.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd29 <strong>Streamer Mode:</strong> Combine any of the above modes with your stream. <strong>Viewers can play through your livestream chat</strong> with a simple command and place the craziest order they can think of. <strong>They'll also complain if you mess up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with your chat: Integration with Twitch, YouTube, Kick, and Tiktok chat \ud83d\udcac</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/69dcf839e67ebb8628bd3219172cc834.poster.avif?t=1768985240\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/69dcf839e67ebb8628bd3219172cc834.webm?t=1768985240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/extras/69dcf839e67ebb8628bd3219172cc834.mp4?t=1768985240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can connect the game to your <strong>YouTube, Kick, Tiktok, or Twitch chat</strong> to receive your own viewers and their orders. <strong>You can chat individually with each of them</strong>, serve them any food you want, and much more! They'll also affect your reviews, helping (or not) you climb the global Streamers ranking.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Open to public","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314340/b70a077a358b6b709c77e9b476f78dec55753082.jpg"},{"name":"Order scheduled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314340/6f052ec78c7303a16d060bbcccc8cf0c4da7869f.jpg"},{"name":"Complete burgie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314340/c3b248f9279aa47b26b44f683d7390c6cc044b27.jpg"},{"name":"Complete vurgie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314340/0d9a9a5b5eab282f145f20b986dcdc7c8c376170.jpg"},{"name":"10 orders","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314340/55fe87e3b7696d9ab4ed6d5b35b10d5dc754c085.jpg"},{"name":"50 orders","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314340/eb89bbb2bfa5a1076f40efaa40c7a08224f624a7.jpg"},{"name":"Best burger shop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314340/d70d275364ac3848ac413a6b737cc2c18a43b301.jpg"},{"name":"Organic recycling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314340/9e2509658632b2a94a8d27a90f46b338a7995d63.jpg"},{"name":"Complete smash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314340/eb6728d68465ead1da9dc1e40158b54e560abdbc.jpg"},{"name":"Rider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3314340/bd8ed30c4c59b127ca63024c580dc054a5bbd5a4.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3314340?t=1768985240","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768985240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/5c5f432a3f90183b73ed93f57d3df2cb3501edbb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768985240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314340/5c5f432a3f90183b73ed93f57d3df2cb3501edbb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768985240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"